    {
      "id": "mQEKm2VDBJoMPPVBRo6pB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 96.14732179187621,
      "y": 476.67569423857253,
      "width": 644.1396484375,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1743474907,
      "version": 385,
      "versionNonce": 990877586,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780912508659,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Daily Active Users 10M\n\nAverage search per user per day = 5\n\nAverage keystrokes per search = 8\n\nTotal Queries per day = 10M * 5 searches * 8 keystrokes = 400M\n\nAverage RPS = 400m / 24 * 3600\n                = 4600 RPS\n   Peak RPS = 5-10x = 25k to 50l brust rps",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Daily Active Users 10M\n\nAverage search per user per day = 5\n\nAverage keystrokes per search = 8\n\nTotal Queries per day = 10M * 5 searches * 8 keystrokes = 400M\n\nAverage RPS = 400m / 24 * 3600\n                = 4600 RPS\n   Peak RPS = 5-10x = 25k to 50l brust rps",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
