      "versionNonce": 201856997,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781020916391,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We will deploy independent trie clusters in multiple geographic regions Each cluster holds suggestions most relevant to its region",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We will deploy independent trie clusters in multiple geographic regions Each cluster holds suggestions most relevant to its region",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "J_lfixvZUKh-GT78wclT0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1220.7653077102848,
      "y": 2706.5315230838833,
      "width": 1312.93896484375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 441803435,
      "version": 410,
      "versionNonce": 2019033957,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781021064033,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We will also identify the most common prefixes like (new, sports) and cache the tree in redis cluster the goal is simple to\nserver as many autocomplete requests as possible directly from memory but this also means that trie would follow eventual consitency",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We will also identify the most common prefixes like (new, sports) and cache the tree in redis cluster the goal is simple to\nserver as many autocomplete requests as possible directly from memory but this also means that trie would follow eventual consitency",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
